{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56456","headline":"还丹金液歌 · 元阳子","name":"还丹金液歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"和气和太初，初气终归一。\n母子本相生，相生又相失。\n阴链玄阴精，月旬嫁於日。\n日月既相交，还丹赩然出。\n北方取河车，南方朱雀一。\n碧水生妙花，白花怀玉质。\n龙虬入相交，刀圭须谨密。\n独弄在乾坤，能滋於万物。\n姹女玄阴精，二种皆归一。\n河上无水银，乃合着阴律。\n荡荡赤龙蟠，火候看容质。\n变作里蹄金，黄芽无根术。\n火记三百篇，知之万不失。\n如骡怀姙驹，自怀其形质。\n（《正统道藏》珠芓号《还丹金液歌注》。\n原有张果注。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元阳子","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56456.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56456","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}